ider":"mal","id":"19151","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60868","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"272045","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"25166","synopsis":"Mio Kisaki, a normal student in her second year, has been friends with Takahiro since he came abroad. There was a little misunderstanding, and now she's going to duel with Bertille, a second year knight. Takahiro couldn't stand back and watch--he's gonna be her begleiter. Mio doesn't even know how to hold a lance, but she realizes jousting is fun while Takahiro teaches her. All the women who wanted Takahiro to be their begleiter are surprised.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kcXqhivuxY3MUOpjFNw7yLLF0aZ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Mio Kisaki, a normal student in her second year, has been friends with Takahiro since he came abroad. There was a little misunderstanding, and now she's going to duel with Bertille, a second year knight. Takahiro couldn't stand back and watch--he's gonna be her begleiter. Mio doesn't even know how to hold a lance, but she realizes jousting is fun while Takahiro teaches her. All the women who wanted Takahiro to be their begleiter are surprised.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kcXqhivuxY3MUOpjFNw7yLLF0aZ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9931","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"19151","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"19151","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60868","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"272045","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"25169","synopsis":"Takahiro elicits helps from Noel a second-year knight student who wants to show just how strong she is by helping to train Mio. The day of the duel comes, and Mio doesn't just learn how fun jousting can be, but also how tough. You'll be surprised how different Mio looks when she shows up to meet Takahiro in the morning. It's time for Mio's duel with Bertille. What will happen?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5ubI4LJPS5icqtFvm6ODS1pIHqn.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Takahiro elicits helps from Noel a second-year knight student who wants to show just how strong she is by helping to train Mio. The day of the duel comes, and Mio doesn't just learn how fun jousting can be, but also how tough. You'll be surprised how different Mio looks when she shows up to meet Takahiro in the morning. It's time for Mio's duel with Bertille. What will happen?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5ubI4LJPS5icqtFvm6ODS1pIHqn.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9931","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"19151","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"19151","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60868","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"272045","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"25167","synopsis":"Akane Ryuuzouji: a woman given an A-ranking in the knight division, a trusted confidant of Mio, and also hails from the same land as Takahiro. A girl in black armor appears before Akane. Akane gets into a fight with some underclassman, and as a result ends up having to fight that black knight. The first year Lisa Eostre is the one wearing that suit of armor! Meanwhile, Mio find herself lost now that she doesn't need to joust anymore...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/388ejPH92Q0wrzqWdlwmI6nRB6Y.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Akane Ryuuzouji: a woman given an A-ranking in the knight division, a trusted confidant of Mio, and also hails from the same land as Takahiro. A girl in black armor appears before Akane. Akane gets into a fight with some underclassman, and as a result ends up having to fight that black knight. The first year Lisa Eostre is the one wearing that suit of armor! Meanwhile, Mio find herself lost now that she doesn't need to joust anymore...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/388ejPH92Q0wrzqWdlwmI6nRB6Y.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9931","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"19151","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"19151","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60868","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"272045","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"25168","synopsis":"Mio realizes how she truly feels about jousting and decides to participate in the summer tournament! Celia, the student council president, invites Mio to have tea with her so she can see how Mio really feels about jousting. After having her entry accepted, Mio goes to visit Noel's house with Takahiro. They meet Noel's younger sister who is confined to a wheelchair, Mireille. Takahiro and Mio learn about why Noel really wants to participate in the summer tournament...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b3kJI53oiZB4fCvGAIzfPs9uUiS.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Mio realizes how she truly feels about jousting and decides to participate in the summer tournament! Celia, the student council president, invites Mio to have tea with her so she can see how Mio really feels about jousting. After having her entry accepted, Mio goes to visit Noel's house with Takahiro. They meet Noel's younger sister who is confined to a wheelchair, Mireille. Takahiro and Mio learn about why Noel really wants to participate in the summer tournament...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b3kJI53oiZB4fCvGAIzfPs9uUiS.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9931","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"19151","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"19151","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60868","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"272045","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"25171","synopsis":"Takahiro runs into Lisa by chance one day, and then learns from Reina, the student council vice president, about Lisa's past. He is then asked by her to become Lisa's begleiter. Takahiro does not know what to do, as he is also being asked by Celia and Noel. Takahiro wanders around town on their day off, only to run into the girls who are also spending their day off in different ways. Takahiro talks a little bit about the arena in which all knights wish to find themselves someday...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xlOrt4SFyP3OHnI3pAjIoa1PACC.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Takahiro runs into Lisa by chance one day, and then learns from Reina, the student council vice president, about Lisa's past. He is then asked by her to become Lisa's begleiter. Takahiro does not know what to do, as he is also being asked by Celia and Noel. Takahiro wanders around town on their day off, only to run into the girls who are also spending their day off in different ways. Takahiro talks a little bit about the arena in which all knights wish to find themselves someday...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xlOrt4SFyP3OHnI3pAjIoa1PACC.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9931","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"19151","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"19151","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60868","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"272045","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"25170","synopsis":"Akane finds herself weak as she admires Celia just way too much. She decides that she must undergo training to overcome this, but rain comes instead. She goes to find shelter in a windmill, and finds Celia there, as well. There's trouble, and they find themselves unable to leave the windmill. Takahiro realizes something is up, and he comes to find them, but you'll never believe what happens...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/htMZpKi6lzFmSZGbMbwvTDqm01.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Akane finds herself weak as she admires Celia just way too much. She decides that she must undergo training to overcome this, but rain comes instead. She goes to find shelter in a windmill, and finds Celia there, as well. There's trouble, and they find themselves unable to leave the windmill. Takahiro realizes something is up, and he comes to find them, but you'll never believe what happens...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/htMZpKi6lzFmSZGbMbwvTDqm01.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9931","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"19151","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"19151","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60868","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"272045","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber